==English==

===Etymology===
Morphologically {{term|sub-|lang=en}} + {{etyl|la}} {{term|limen|līmen|threshold|lang=la}} (genitive {{term|limen|līminis|lang=la}}) + {{term|-al|lang=en}}, a [[calque]] of {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|unterschwellig||beneath the threshold|lang=de}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# {{context|of a stimulus}} Below the [[threshold]] of [[conscious]] [[perception]], especially if still able to produce a [[response]].

